# ONE NUMBER, SENT TO SEVERAL PLACES AT ONCE.
#
#   python3 -m sparkblocks run fan-out.spark
#
# `fan` runs every branch on the SAME number, then combines them.
# Each branch is a line starting `- `, and a branch can be one block
# or a whole chain.
#
# Try: change `sum` to `max`, or `list` to see each answer separately.

const -5

fan sum
    - put target1
    - put target2
    - gain 2
      put target3

var target3
say
